                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "DefaultIngressClass admission plugin",
                  "text": "On create, if spec.ingressClassName is nil, the plugin lists IngressClasses annotated ingressclass.kubernetes.io/is-default-class=\"true\" and writes:\n\n  ingress.Spec.IngressClassName = &defaultClass.Name"
