                  "type": "terminal",
                  "title": "What that rule would actually do",
                  "text": "# a path entry must name a real backend Service\n$ kubectl -n edge get svc\nNAME   TYPE        CLUSTER-IP      EXTERNAL-IP   PORT(S)   AGE\napi    ClusterIP   10.96.140.221   <none>        80/TCP    9d"
