            "type": "terminal",
            "title": "The Pod runs. The claim is allocated. And yet.",
            "text": "$ kubectl -n compute get pod tf\nNAME   READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\ntf     1/1     Running   0          30s\n\n$ kubectl -n compute get resourceclaims\nNAME          STATE                AGE\ntf-sgx-7k2xv  allocated,reserved   30s\n\n$ kubectl -n compute get pod tf -o jsonpath='{.spec.containers[0].resources}{\"\\n\"}'\n{}"
