                  "title": "Sticky, and still remote",
                  "text": "$ kubectl -n near exec caller-w1 -- wget -qO- geo-svc\ngeo-7d9c5b8f4-8mfqs on worker-2\n$ kubectl -n near exec caller-w1 -- wget -qO- geo-svc\ngeo-7d9c5b8f4-8mfqs on worker-2"
