                  "text": "$ kubectl explain service.spec.topologyKeys\nerror: field \"topologyKeys\" does not exist\n\n$ kubectl -n near get deploy geo -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.topologySpreadConstraints}{\"\\n\"}'\n[{\"maxSkew\":1,\"topologyKey\":\"kubernetes.io/hostname\",\"whenUnsatisfiable\":\"ScheduleAnyway\"}]"
