                  "title": "Pending, and the reason is the taint",
                  "text": "$ kubectl -n dock get pod pier\nNAME   READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\npier   0/1     Pending   0          45s\n\n$ kubectl -n dock describe pod pier | tail -4\nEvents:\n  Type     Reason            Age   From               Message\n  ----     ------            ----  ----               -------\n  Warning  FailedScheduling  44s   default-scheduler  0/3 nodes are available: 1 node(s) had untolerated taint(s), 2 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling."
