              "teach": "<code>local</code> is the production-grade cousin of <code>hostPath</code> and it is the right answer to a different question. It refuses to exist without <code>nodeAffinity</code>, which is exactly the property the task rules out with \"whatever node the Pod lands on\". Read the task for which semantics it wants before you upgrade the technology."
