                  "type": "terminal",
                  "title": "Skipping verification does not supply a credential",
                  "text": "root@amber-worker-2:~# kubeadm join 10.1.0.7:6443 --discovery-token-unsafe-skip-ca-verification\n[preflight] Running pre-flight checks\nerror execution phase preflight: [preflight] Some fatal errors occurred:\n\t[ERROR Discovery]: using token-based discovery without --discovery-token-ca-cert-hash can be unsafe. Set --discovery-token-unsafe-skip-ca-verification to continue, or specify a token\n[preflight] If you know what you are checking for, you can make a check non-fatal with `--ignore-preflight-errors=...`\nTo see the stack trace of this error execute with --v=5 or higher"
