                  "title": "It does return the right certificate",
                  "text": "root@amber-worker-1:~# openssl s_client -connect 127.0.0.1:10250 </dev/null 2>/dev/null | \\\n    openssl x509 -noout -issuer -ext extendedKeyUsage\nissuer=CN = amber-worker-1-ca@1783847642\nX509v3 Extended Key Usage:\n    TLS Web Server Authentication"
